usage: rot coach [-h] [--shape SHAPE] [--policy FILE] [--out FILE]
                 [--max-inflight K] [--amount N] [--cap N] [--window W]
                 [--aggregate] [--ledger FILE] [--max-states N] [--rule ID]
                 [--quiet]

optional arguments:
  -h, --help        show this help message and exit
  --shape SHAPE     which shape to coach: 'spendcap' (a .dw policy, the
                    default) or 'exfiltration' (the NoExfiltration harness --
                    no policy file needed)
  --policy FILE     spend-cap policy file (.dw) to coach (the AWS Dogwood
                    vertical slice; --shape spendcap)
  --out FILE        write the coaching artifact JSON here [default: stdout]
  --max-inflight K  bounded concurrency pool K (spend-cap .dw policies)
  --amount N        per-request amount override (spend-cap .dw policies)
  --cap N           spend cap override (spend-cap .dw policies)
  --window W        temporal window W (spend-cap .dw policies)
  --aggregate       coach the rules from the decision ledger: which
                    prompts/tool-descriptions cause blocks, which rules block
                    legitimate work, and a re-proof that any relaxation stays
                    safe (B5)
  --ledger FILE     decision ledger (JSONL or JSON) to aggregate (required
                    with --aggregate)
  --max-states N    bounded-search budget for the relaxation re-proof
  --rule ID         rule id for the relaxation re-proof [default: derived from
                    --shape]
  --quiet           suppress the human summary
